---
import CaseContents from "./CaseContents.astro";
---
<article class="grounded-case">
  <header class="intro">
    <div class="meta case-meta"><span class="case-meta__client-full">Grounded</span><span class="case-meta__client-short">Grounded</span><span class="case-meta__highlight">10× engagement</span><span class="case-meta__role">Senior UX Strategist</span></div>
    <div class="intro__grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">UX Strategy &amp; Behavioral Design</p><h1>Grounded<br /><span class="heading-accent">Climate</span><br />Solutions</h1></div>
      <p class="lede">A climate solutions platform that turned anxiety into community action. Behavioral design shifted from crisis-led imagery to solution-oriented storytelling, driving 300% increase in webinar registrations and 10x content engagement through strategic visual language.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <CaseContents links={[{"href": "#case-section-1", "label": "Research"}, {"href": "#case-section-2", "label": "Visual language"}, {"href": "#case-section-3", "label": "Content system"}, {"href": "#case-section-4", "label": "Results"}]} />

  <figure class="hero"><img src="/images/grounded_hero.webp" alt="A hiker walking on a snow-covered mountain ridge" loading="eager" decoding="async" /></figure>

  <section class="research" aria-labelledby="research-title" id="case-section-1" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="section-heading"><p>01 / Research</p><h2 id="research-title">Research &amp; Behavioral<br />Design Framework</h2></div>
    <div class="research__copy"><p>Analysis of behavioral research revealed audiences exposed to solution-framing alongside problem acknowledgment demonstrate measurably higher intent to act. The team audited 10 environmental nonprofit sites and benchmarked against editorial platforms like TED.</p><p>The consistent finding: design that emphasized community and achievable action consistently outperformed crisis-led visual approaches. This insight shaped the entire design strategy—moving away from disaster imagery toward solution-oriented storytelling that conveyed both urgency and agency.</p></div>
    <div class="research__art"><figure><img src="/images/grounded_01.webp" alt="Grounded color system with icy neutrals, misty greens, and calm blues" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure><figure><img src="/images/grounded_02.webp" alt="Responsive design process artifact" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure><figure><img src="/images/grounded_03.webp" alt="Grounded website and campaign design shown in a desktop mockup" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure></div>
  </section>

  <section class="language" aria-labelledby="language-title" id="case-section-2" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="language__head"><p>02 / Visual language</p><h2 id="language-title">Visual Language for<br /><span class="heading-accent">Emotional Regulation</span></h2></div>
    <div class="language__grid"><div class="language__copy"><p>The visual system used icy neutrals, misty greens, and calm blues instead of high-contrast crisis colors. Typography balanced authority with warmth. Photography guidelines prioritized human connection and solution-oriented imagery over disaster documentation.</p><p>This approach required resisting conventional environmental design patterns that rely on shock and urgency. Instead, the system communicated care, competence, and community—visual signals that audiences subconsciously register as trustworthy and actionable rather than paralyzing.</p></div><figure class="portrait portrait--explorer"><img src="/images/grounded_04.webp" alt="Winter explorer in Grounded’s solution-oriented photography system" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure><figure class="portrait portrait--julia"><img src="/images/grounded_julia.webp" alt="Grounded speaker profile component" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure><figure class="portrait portrait--bear"><img src="/images/grounded_05.webp" alt="Polar bear content illustration in Grounded’s visual language" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure></div>
  </section>

  <section class="architecture" aria-labelledby="architecture-title" id="case-section-3" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="architecture__title"><p>03 / A system for action</p><h2 id="architecture-title">Modular Content Architecture for Scalability</h2></div>
    <figure><img src="/images/grounded_web_01.webp" alt="Grounded website shown across desktop and mobile layouts" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure>
    <div class="architecture__copy"><p>Modular story components were designed to require no developer support, enabling the small Grounded team to update content independently. Navigation was structured around action categories rather than issue categories—meeting users at their intent rather than the organization's taxonomy.</p><p>WordPress CMS was designed for small teams to maintain independently. Component documentation was written for non-technical users, and the system was handed off with comprehensive editorial guidelines ensuring design consistency as new content was added.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="results" aria-labelledby="results-title" id="case-section-4" tabindex="-1">
    <div><p>04 / Results</p><h2 id="results-title">Results &amp;<br />Community Impact</h2></div>
    <div class="results__facts"><div><strong>300%</strong><span>increase in webinar registrations</span></div><div><strong>10x</strong><span>increase in content engagement</span></div><div><strong>&lt;3s</strong><span>page load time</span></div></div>
    <div class="results__copy"><p>300% increase in webinar registrations in the first quarter post-launch. 10x increase in content engagement versus the previous site. Full team achieved self-sufficiency within two weeks with zero support requests, proving the documentation and component system were effective.</p><p>The platform was recognized by three environmental organizations for its innovative approach to behavioral design in climate communication. Sub-3 second load times were maintained across all pages, ensuring the solution-focused experience wasn't undermined by technical friction.</p></div>
  </section>
</article>

<style>
  .grounded-case{--ink:#153d3a;--deep:#123f3c;--mist:#f3f6f2;--sage:#82b3a6;--ice:#dce9ed;--line:rgba(19,63,60,.24);background:var(--mist);color:var(--ink);font-family:Manrope,Arial,sans-serif;overflow:hidden}.grounded-case :global(*){box-sizing:border-box}.grounded-case :global(figure),.grounded-case :global(p),.grounded-case :global(h1),.grounded-case :global(h2){margin:0}.grounded-case :global(img){display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.intro{padding:28px 4vw 84px}.meta{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding-bottom:14px;text-transform:uppercase}.meta span:last-child{text-align:right}.intro__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .7fr;gap:9vw;padding-top:78px}.eyebrow,.section-heading>p,.language__head>p,.architecture__title>p,.results>div>p{color:#356f63;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.intro h1{font-size:clamp(70px,12.5vw,190px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.09em;line-height:.76;margin-top:24px}.intro h1 .heading-accent,.language h2 .heading-accent{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-style:normal;font-weight:400}.lede{align-self:end;font-size:clamp(20px,2.05vw,30px);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.24;max-width:530px}.hero{height:min(54vw,850px);min-height:400px}.research{padding:145px 4vw}.section-heading,.language__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:8vw}.section-heading h2,.language h2,.architecture h2,.results h2{font-size:clamp(44px,6.2vw,104px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.075em;line-height:.9}.research__copy,.architecture__copy,.results__copy{display:grid;gap:26px;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin:86px 0 72px 42%;max-width:820px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.52}.research__copy p:last-child,.architecture__copy p:last-child,.results__copy p:last-child{color:#54706d}.research__art{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .36fr 1.35fr;gap:20px;align-items:end}.research__art figure:first-child{aspect-ratio:1.46}.research__art figure:nth-child(2){aspect-ratio:.72;margin-bottom:6vw}.research__art figure:last-child{aspect-ratio:2.02}.language{background:var(--sage);padding:144px 4vw}.language__head{padding-bottom:90px}.language__head>p{color:#153d3a}.language h2{color:#103b38}.language__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .48fr .48fr .48fr;gap:20px;align-items:end}.language__copy{align-self:start;display:grid;gap:28px;font-size:clamp(18px,1.65vw,25px);letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.34;max-width:550px}.language__copy p:last-child{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}.portrait{aspect-ratio:.72}.portrait--explorer{margin-top:80px}.portrait--julia{margin-bottom:90px}.architecture{padding:144px 4vw 0}.architecture__title{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:8vw;margin-bottom:86px}.architecture figure{background:var(--sage);padding:5vw 3vw}.architecture figure img{aspect-ratio:1.78;object-fit:contain}.architecture__copy{margin-bottom:0;padding-bottom:140px}.results{background:var(--deep);color:#eef8f4;padding:136px 4vw}.results>div:first-child{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:8vw}.results>div>p{color:#a4d7ca}.results__facts{border-top:1px solid rgba(236,248,244,.32);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin-top:90px}.results__facts div{border-right:1px solid rgba(236,248,244,.32);padding:22px 20px 38px 0}.results__facts div+div{padding-left:20px}.results__facts div:last-child{border:0}.results__facts strong{display:block;font-size:clamp(58px,8vw,130px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.1em;line-height:.8}.results__facts span{display:block;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;margin-top:22px;max-width:125px}.results__copy{color:#eef8f4;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:108px}.results__copy p:last-child{color:#b4d2ca}@media(max-width:800px){.intro{padding-bottom:54px}.meta{grid-template-columns:1fr auto}.meta span:last-child{display:none}.intro__grid,.section-heading,.language__head,.architecture__title,.results>div:first-child{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px;padding-top:0}.intro__grid{padding-top:50px}.intro h1{font-size:clamp(68px,21vw,125px)}.hero{height:52vw;min-height:280px}.research,.language,.architecture,.results{padding-top:84px;padding-bottom:84px}.research__copy,.architecture__copy,.results__copy{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin:54px 0}.research__art{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.research__art figure:last-child{grid-column:span 2}.research__art figure:nth-child(2){margin-bottom:0}.language__head{padding-bottom:54px}.language__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.language__copy{grid-column:span 2;margin-bottom:26px}.portrait--explorer,.portrait--julia{margin:0}.portrait--bear{grid-column:span 2;aspect-ratio:1.45}.architecture figure{margin:0 -4vw;padding:9vw 4vw}.architecture__copy{padding-bottom:0}.results__facts{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-top:54px}.results__facts div,.results__facts div+div{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(236,248,244,.32);border-right:0;padding:20px 0 30px}.results__copy{padding-top:0}}
</style>
